{"3200520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Banban's Garten: Distorting Clay", "steam_appid": 3200520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-enter Banban's Kindergarten from a new perspective in this brand new story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel full world immersion as you interact with the environments and characters as you attempt to escape from the kindergarten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/fd90ad81f836194a79a99cd096fa3b81.poster.avif?t=1781192941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/fd90ad81f836194a79a99cd096fa3b81.webm?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/fd90ad81f836194a79a99cd096fa3b81.mp4?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brand New Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banban's Garten: Distorting Clay is not a remake of the original series. Rather, it's its own special story that takes place inside of Banban's Kindergarten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/143b98c49c2c356aa60dca8bac5d90ea.poster.avif?t=1781192941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/143b98c49c2c356aa60dca8bac5d90ea.webm?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/143b98c49c2c356aa60dca8bac5d90ea.mp4?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banban's Garten: Distorting Clay features the shapeshifting mechanic, allowing you to shift into familiar monsters that contain their own unique gameplay abilities and exclusive mechanics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/8f7f6f69e6d6a11d950e95819ff88bd2.poster.avif?t=1781192941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/8f7f6f69e6d6a11d950e95819ff88bd2.webm?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/8f7f6f69e6d6a11d950e95819ff88bd2.mp4?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-enter Banban's Kindergarten from a new perspective in this brand new story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel full world immersion as you interact with the environments and characters as you attempt to escape from the kindergarten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/fd90ad81f836194a79a99cd096fa3b81.poster.avif?t=1781192941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/fd90ad81f836194a79a99cd096fa3b81.webm?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200520/extras/fd90ad81f836194a79a99cd096fa3b81.mp4?t=1781192941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brand New Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banban's Gart